1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:10,481
Nepal is going through an epidemiological transition: infections are retreating, and non communicable diseases now cause about two thirds of deaths.

2
00:00:10,481 --> 00:00:15,820
Chronic lung disease from smoke, heart disease and stroke lead the list.

3
00:00:15,820 --> 00:00:21,080
One adult in four has high blood pressure, and nearly three in ten use tobacco.

